# The command palette (⇧⌘P): every enabled menu item, the connection's
# tables and tabs, Connect rows, the preferences' toggles; the TUIs' fuzzy
# filter; running a row; the database switch is refused on SQLite (not in
# the palette, a notice from the menu action)
saved-add Local sqlite://$LACE_SMOKE_DB
connect $LACE_SMOKE_DB
table big
palette
expect-palette-row Open table big
expect-palette-row Refresh
expect-palette-row Go to Row…
expect-palette-row New Connection Tab
expect-palette-row Connect to Local
expect-palette-row Restore the cursor position: on
expect-no-palette-row Switch Database…
expect-no-palette-row Command Palette…
palette-filter refr
expect-palette-first Refresh
palette-filter zzzqqq
expect-no-palette-row Refresh
palette-filter new query
palette-run New Query
expect-tabs 2
palette
palette-filter big
palette-run Open table big
expect-table big
palette
palette-run Restore the cursor position: on
expect-notice Restore the cursor position: off
palette
expect-palette-row Restore the cursor position: off
palette-close
switch-database
expect-notice A SQLite file is one database
palette
palette-run Connect to Local
expect-connections 2
quit
